                    <p class="text-primary text-sm">Kick Boks Şampiyonu</p>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <blockquote class="text-base-content/70 italic">
                  "3 yıl önce hiçbir deneyimim yoktu. Şimdi şampiyon olarak insanlara ilham veriyorum. Hepsi Kleomarcus'ta başladı."
                </blockquote>
                <%= star_rating(5) %>
              </div>
            </div>
          </article>

          <!-- Testimonial 6 -->
          <article class="flex-shrink-0 w-[90%] sm:w-[calc(50%-12px)] lg:w-[calc(50%-16px)]" data-carousel-target="slide" role="group" aria-roledescription="slide" aria-label="6 / 9: Kerem B.">
            <div class="card bg-base-200 shadow-lg h-full">
              <div class="card-body">
                <div class="flex items-center gap-4 mb-4">
                  <div class="avatar">
                    <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-full ring ring-primary ring-offset-base-100 ring-offset-2">
                      <img src="https://picsum.photos/id/1013/100/100" alt="Kerem B. portresi" width="100" height="100" loading="lazy">
                    </div>
                  </div>
                  <div>
                    <h3 class="font-display font-bold text-base-content">Kerem B.</h3>
                    <p class="text-primary text-sm">MMA Dövüşçüsü</p>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <blockquote class="text-base-content/70 italic">
                  "Kleomarcus'ta teknik gelişimim inanılmaz hızlı oldu. Profesyonel kariyerime burada başladım."
                </blockquote>
                <%= star_rating(5) %>
              </div>
            </div>
          </article>

          <!-- Testimonial 7 -->
          <article class="flex-shrink-0 w-[90%] sm:w-[calc(50%-12px)] lg:w-[calc(50%-16px)]" data-carousel-target="slide" role="group" aria-roledescription="slide" aria-label="7 / 9: Ayşe T.">
            <div class="card bg-base-200 shadow-lg h-full">
              <div class="card-body">
                <div class="flex items-center gap-4 mb-4">
                  <div class="avatar">
                    <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-full ring ring-primary ring-offset-base-100 ring-offset-2">
