                    </div>
                  </div>
                  <div>
                    <h3 class="font-display font-bold text-base-content">Ayşe T.</h3>
                    <p class="text-primary text-sm">Fitness Antrenörü</p>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <blockquote class="text-base-content/70 italic">
                  "Hem sporcu hem de antrenör olarak Kleomarcus'un kalitesi beni her zaman şaşırtıyor. Mükemmel bir ekip."
                </blockquote>
                <%= star_rating(5) %>
              </div>
            </div>
          </article>

          <!-- Testimonial 8 -->
          <article class="flex-shrink-0 w-[90%] sm:w-[calc(50%-12px)] lg:w-[calc(50%-16px)]" data-carousel-target="slide" role="group" aria-roledescription="slide" aria-label="8 / 9: Can Ö.">
            <div class="card bg-base-200 shadow-lg h-full">
              <div class="card-body">
                <div class="flex items-center gap-4 mb-4">
                  <div class="avatar">
                    <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-full ring ring-primary ring-offset-base-100 ring-offset-2">
                      <img src="https://picsum.photos/id/1016/100/100" alt="Can Ö. portresi" width="100" height="100" loading="lazy">
                    </div>
                  </div>
                  <div>
                    <h3 class="font-display font-bold text-base-content">Can Ö.</h3>
                    <p class="text-primary text-sm">Yeni Başlayan</p>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <blockquote class="text-base-content/70 italic">
                  "2 ay önce başladım ve kendimi çok daha güçlü hissediyorum. Antrenörler sabırlı ve motive edici."
                </blockquote>
                <%= star_rating(4.5) %>
              </div>
            </div>
          </article>

          <!-- Testimonial 9 -->
          <article class="flex-shrink-0 w-[90%] sm:w-[calc(50%-12px)] lg:w-[calc(50%-16px)]" data-carousel-target="slide" role="group" aria-roledescription="slide" aria-label="9 / 9: Zeynep A.">
            <div class="card bg-base-200 shadow-lg h-full">
              <div class="card-body">
                <div class="flex items-center gap-4 mb-4">
                  <div class="avatar">
                    <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-full ring ring-primary ring-offset-base-100 ring-offset-2">
                      <img src="https://picsum.photos/id/1019/100/100" alt="Zeynep A. portresi" width="100" height="100" loading="lazy">
                    </div>
                  </div>
                  <div>
                    <h3 class="font-display font-bold text-base-content">Zeynep A.</h3>
                    <p class="text-primary text-sm">Boks Şampiyonu 2025</p>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <blockquote class="text-base-content/70 italic">
                  "Kleomarcus'un modern ekipmanları ve deneyimli kadrosu bana şampiyonluk yolunda rehberlik etti."
                </blockquote>
